# MATRIX: EDIT, SELECT to slot 3 (empty). KNOB1 picks a source (RAND),
# KNOB2 opens the destination picker on the sound's Timbre and it commits
# a second later; KNOB3 sets the amount, KNOB4 an offset. ALGORITHM turns
# to page B: KNOB2 a curve, KNOB3 polarity, KNOB1 a VIA (VEL), KNOB4 off
# and on again. SEL shows the chain, SEL comes back.
--button 0.05:PLAY/STOP
--button 0.10:EDIT
--turn 0.15:SELECT:2
--turn 0.20:KNOB1:3
--turn 0.25:KNOB2:2
--turn 1.40:KNOB3:45
--turn 1.45:KNOB4:-10
--turn 1.50:ALGORITHM:1
--turn 1.55:KNOB2:2
--turn 1.60:KNOB3:1
--turn 1.65:KNOB1:1
--turn 1.70:KNOB4:-1
--turn 1.75:KNOB4:1
--button 1.80:SEL
--button 1.90:SEL
